[h1]Variations of Cultural Polygamy[/h1]

Cultural traditions that set how many spouses a ruler may take, from two wives up to fifteen.

[h2]Traditions[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Two Wives[/b]: up to 2 spouses and 2 consorts.
[*][b]Three Wives[/b]: up to 3 spouses and 3 consorts.
[*][b]Four Wives[/b]: up to 4 spouses and 4 consorts.
[*][b]Five Wives[/b]: up to 5 spouses and 5 consorts.
[*][b]Nine Wives[/b]: up to 9 spouses and 9 consorts.
[*][b]Fifteen Wives[/b]: up to 15 spouses and 15 consorts.
[/list]

Each tradition also makes romance schemes easier against your own spouses. A culture can have only one marriage tradition, so these cannot be combined with each other or with Monogamous, Concubines or Polygamous.

[h2]Works With[/h2]
[list]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3446353510]AGOT - Secrets of the Higher Mysteries[/url]: its magic decision can grant these traditions when this mod is loaded.
[/list]

[h2]Feedback[/h2]
Bug reports and suggestions are always welcome.
